[0.0, "o", "Investigating REAL data for tenant \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: can you check hubspot and tell me the closed won rate in the last 3 months?\r\n\u001b[2m2026-09-23 19:50:37\u001b[0m [\u001b[33m\u001b[1mwarning  \u001b[0m] \u001b[1mmcp.nothing_admissible        \u001b[0m \u001b[36mlabel\u001b[0m=\u001b[35mposthog\u001b[0m \u001b[36mreason\u001b[0m=\u001b[35m'the server was queried and offered no tool Cortex can admit; every tool must declare readOnlyHint: true'\u001b[0m\r\nRead-only: no write capability exists in the tool registry.\r\nCapabilities available to \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: github, hubspot, posthog, slack\r\n  [  0.1s]          checking what data exists\r\n  [ 12.1s]          found posthog__list_projects\r\n  [ 12.1s]          checking memory for prior context\r\n  [ 17.3s] step 1   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 22.2s] step 1   calling hubspot__closed_won\r\n  [ 22.2s] step 1   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 22.2s] step 1   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 24.7s] step 1   got hubspot__closed_won (2 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 24.7s] step 1   got hubspot__search (3 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 24.7s] step 1   got hubspot__search (4 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 24.7s] step 2   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 30.1s] step 2   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 30.1s] step 2   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 30.1s] step 2   got read hubspot.search in full (\u2588\u2588 rows) (4 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 32.1s] step 2   got hubspot__search (5 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 32.1s] step 2   got hubspot__search (6 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 32.1s] step 3   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 39.9s] step 3   got read hubspot.search in full (\u2588\u2588 rows) (6 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 39.9s] step 4   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 62.3s]          drafting the report from 6 observation(s)\r\n  [ 75.7s]          checking every citation resolves\r\n  [ 75.7s]          re-reading each claim against its own evidence\r\n  sufficiency gate: skipped, this report asserts no cause (0.0s)\r\n  [ 83.0s]          writing the report\r\n\r\n==============================================================================\r\nQ: Can you check HubSpot and tell me the closed won rate in the last 3 months?\r\n==============================================================================\r\n\r\nConfidence: high\r\nTook 76s over 4 steps, 52,896 tokens, 6 observations gathered, 4 cited\r\n\r\nANSWER\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  The HubSpot closed-won rate for the last \u2588 months (2026-06-23 to 2026-09-23) is \u2588\u2588.\u2588% \u2014 \u2588 won out of \u2588\u2588 total closed deals (\u2588 won, \u2588\u2588 lost).  [hubspot.closed_won fc28ce7c, hubspot.search f0afee98]\r\n\r\nFINDINGS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Closed-won rate, last \u2588 months (2026-06-23 to 2026-09-23)  (high)\r\n    - Of \u2588\u2588 deals closed in the last \u2588 months, \u2588 were closed-won and \u2588\u2588 were closed-lost, a closed-won rate of \u2588\u2588.\u2588% (\u2588/\u2588\u2588).  [hubspot.closed_won fc28ce7c, hubspot.search f0afee98]\r\n    - Closed-won total value in the period was $\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 across \u2588 deals.  [hubspot.closed_won fc28ce7c]\r\n    - Closed-lost total value in the period was $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 across \u2588\u2588 deals.  [hubspot.search f0afee98]\r\n  Comparison to the prior \u2588-month period  (high)\r\n    - In the preceding \u2588 months (2026-03-23 to 2026-06-23), the closed-won rate was \u2588.\u2588% (\u2588 won of \u2588\u2588 closed), lower than the \u2588\u2588.\u2588% rate in the most recent \u2588 months.  [hubspot.search 4f181eab, hubspot.search c4844231, hubspot.closed_won fc28ce7c, hubspot.search f0afee98]\r\n\r\nRISKS AND CAVEATS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Six of the nine won deals and several lost deals in the earlier period share identical bulk-import creation timestamps (2026-01-05), suggesting some close dates may reflect a backfill/import rather than organic close activity, which could affect period-over-period comparisons.\r\n\r\nDATA QUALITY\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Rate is computed only over deals with a stage of closedwon or closedlost within the close_date window; open/in-progress pipeline deals are excluded and do not affect this rate.\r\n  - The github commits sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github deployments sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github issues sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github links sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog annotations sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog events sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n\r\nSOURCES\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  fc28ce7c  hubspot.closed_won  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closed_won=2026-06-23..2026-09-23\r\n  f0afee98  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closedate=2026-06-23..2026-09-23&hs_is_closed_lost=true\r\n  4f181eab  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closedate=2026-03-23..2026-06-23&hs_is_closed_won=true\r\n  c4844231  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closedate=2026-03-23..2026-0